  <item>
    <title>离开猛追湾，一起去旅行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/696480c0f8b05f9f751af417</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">696480c0f8b05f9f751af417</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 12 Jan 2026 05:23:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HELLO，各位听众朋友们，欢迎收听《在猛追湾读书》2026年的第一期节目~久违了，抱歉了，迟到的2025年总结（AKA 流水账旅行笔记）就跟朋友们一起分享吧，大家听个乐呵。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 广州、深圳：家庭特种兵旅行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="290">04:50</a>韩国首尔：Coldplay演唱会、爵士俱乐部Club Evans、MMCA韩国国立现代美术馆</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlUtQQpx0O2wRZhnSAfGsQurAm-K.jpg"></figure><p><span>让慕克作品</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSJKtFM5kulplhaXFWPOchOKDDu.jpg"></figure><p><span>首尔美术馆里的潮流小韩女</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a>日本东京、京都：展览馆、美术馆：草间弥生美术馆、夏目漱石纪念馆、村上春树展览馆、国立西洋美术馆、京瓷美术馆；演出：Brad Mehldau三重奏、东京爱乐乐团音乐会；电影：UPLINK新风馆娄烨电影。以及一些无关紧要的流水账总结。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1852">30:52</a>北京：电影资料馆看电影，重塑雕像的权利音乐纪录片；国博列宾展、松美术馆张晓刚作品展；拜见文艺老专家戴锦华老师、贾樟柯导演、娄烨导演。</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmLgdrvI4LmbdenoSMbUaUkm9jns.jpg"></figure><p><span>翟永明写给张晓刚</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 阿联酋迪拜、阿布扎比，扎哈·哈迪德的徒子徒孙非标建筑之多开了眼；多元人种和风貌还是很不一样；从猛追湾走到波斯湾，很难评说。</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgcHO8FqTTPHS_HSf9yKVaKeE7kf.jpg"></figure><p><span>从MZW走到BSW</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6586aa9ac9786459696babf1/lqvN3uNZOxd2V1O8vHfhNUFPbNxv.m4a" length="49284302" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhCmlX8Hg0QMGH_urTGU0OD1XSjn.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>晴耕雨读 | 困住了，那就读书吧！feat.触底访谈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d12664a56ca3e0c4af9dbe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d12664a56ca3e0c4af9dbe</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 10:42:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HELLO，朋友们，好久不见~本期节目是我串台好朋友泰老师的《触底访谈》，一起聊聊那些伴我们走出困境或者为我们的生活提供能量的书。非常推荐我的听众朋友们订阅《触底访谈》，在人生的低潮叙事找到属于自己的答案。关于《触底访谈》：<a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67f6456481d0f4672321e2d2" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67f6456481d0f4672321e2d2">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">01:14</a> 在 猛追湾读书 是一档什么样的播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="396">06:36</a> 寒冬期不完全生存手册：Angela的读书省钱Tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="759">12:39</a> Angela的推荐1：白先勇《台北人》，时代浪潮下的起伏人生，活下去比什么都重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1549">25:49</a> Teddy的推荐1：史铁生《我与地坛》，一个鲜活的「公园十分钟效应」个案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1901">31:41</a> Angela和Teddy的推荐2：罗英锡《反正竞赛还很长》，很精妙的互文结构，真诚的职涯自传</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2527">42:07</a> Angela的推荐3：吉井忍《东京八平米》，八平米看似困境，但也有它能匹配的活法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a> Teddy的推荐3: 松本大洋《东京平常日》，还是会浪漫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3267">54:27</a> 晴耕雨读，开卷有益</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚扩展延伸</span></p><span></span><p><span>图书:《伤心咖啡馆之歌》[美]卡森·麦卡勒斯 / 《南方高速》[阿根廷] 胡里奥·科塔萨尔 /《孽子》白先勇 /《树犹如此》白先勇 /《十年一觉电影梦：李安传》张靓蓓 编著 /《格外的活法》吉井忍 /《我在北京送快递》胡安焉</span></p><span></span><p><span>影视: &nbsp;孽子 / 完美的日子 / 新西游记 / 新西游记之春季露营 / 地球游戏厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 本期歌单</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tune Up: 好运设计 - 饭卡/WILLIM缪维霖</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tune Down: 꿈과 책과 힘과 벽 (dreams, books, power and walls) - Jannabi</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6586aa9ac9786459696babf1/lkM7hjZclJQJqA5woteJFVbNbOXl.m4a" length="82639361" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrxNZGI9-DQSoRiDVQATZoZujM5g.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>陈冲-【猫鱼】一位电影人与她的记忆碎片</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686fbd0c60f8f77d40dd6906</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686fbd0c60f8f77d40dd6906</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Jul 2025 13:23:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HELLO，各位朋友们，好久不见，欢迎收听久违了的《在猛追湾读书》，本期我们来分享来自著名女演员陈冲的《猫鱼》。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="18">00:18</a> 坦白讲，不更新就是懒了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a>《猫鱼》在当今出版市场真的有够厚，你有多久没看过名人传记和文集了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a>陈冲是个有良好阅读和书写习惯的写作者，书中有大量的家族史细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="282">04:42</a>上半部分确实写的更好，但作为文娱八卦爱好者真的很爱创作背后的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="447">07:27</a> 关于文字里的优越与自恋，优秀的背面混杂着天生的自卑、不安全感，不安分是最好的动能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 关于文字里的真实与虚伪，关于本书之外的一些讨论。艺术创作者当是如此复杂与矛盾。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 推荐看下本书的实体版，印刷和装帧很不错，收集了她与家人的很多照片。她的剧照、硬照还是很有表现力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Lee Konitz Quartet - In A Sentimental Mood</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Alexandre Tharaud,Nemanja Radulovic,Olivier Rosset - Mélodie</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Fabrice Planchat,Quatuor Ebène - Misty</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6586aa9ac9786459696babf1/lnqgn0gTFy145g_75V5Q83Uy0dad.m4a" length="34725627" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoVR25Voir7x778G05Bf4hiMKV0H.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>爵得是也不是-聊聊三本爵士乐书籍</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/678fc1979420ede9d1a98226</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">678fc1979420ede9d1a98226</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jan 2025 15:48:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HELLO，朋友们你们好，欢迎收听最新一期的节目。这期我们集中聊三本爵士乐相关书籍，后藤雅洋《好想听懂爵士乐》，石黑一雄《小夜曲-音乐与黄昏五故事集》，村上春树《爵士乐群英谱》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 怎么就开始听爵士乐了，浅学两年的一些心得体会，听专辑和看现场的差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> 后藤雅洋《好想听懂爵士乐》，很细致的入门科普书、工具书，适合送零基础朋友，也可以供进阶爱好者查漏补缺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 石黑一雄《小夜曲-音乐与黄昏五故事集》，忧伤爵士乐手，如何面对才华不够的平庸人生是个永恒命题；现实世界里的爵士乐大师人生也多为悲伤叙事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1178">19:38</a> 村上春树《爵士乐群英谱》，全球知名爵士乐老懂哥的听音乐个人故事，但有没有可能他和我们听的已经不是一种“爵士”</span></p><span></span><p><span>《小夜曲-音乐与黄昏五故事集》歌单：</span><a href="https://music.163.com/#/playlist?id=7116050686" data-url="https://music.163.com/#/playlist?id=7116050686"><span>music.163.com</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: Bossa Nova - Blue Bossa</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Miles Davis,John Coltrane,Cannonball Adderley - On Green Dolphin Street</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Bill Evans - Walts for Debby</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Wayne Shorter - Footprints</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Art Blakey - Moaning</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6586aa9ac9786459696babf1/liTXHEsfONIi_KiMDhrUcPE_iwwn.m4a" length="35720778" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:24:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvrDqyOuopb_ZXMXwEnVV9Sa_Ym7.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>琼瑶自传【我的故事】-归去，也无风雨也无晴</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6751dff217cd5416add0d401</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6751dff217cd5416add0d401</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Dec 2024 19:16:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HELLO，朋友们，本期是一期特别节目，我们来阅读作家琼瑶的自传《我的故事-雪与火交织的一生》，谨以此纪念对我们一代电视儿童影响重大的华语作家——琼瑶阿姨。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="74">1:14</a>琼瑶的作品等于琼瑶小说+琼瑶影视剧+琼瑶歌曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="254">4:14</a>琼瑶的家庭介绍，与生俱来自卑与高敏感是造就天生作家的先天条件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a>童年的颠沛流离，琼瑶经历的战争、逃难、贫穷、饥饿太过残酷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a>青春期的琼瑶，最早的东亚家庭鸡娃受害者之一，但也“逼迫”她走上职业写作之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a>想要逃离一切，却又进入第一段失败的婚姻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a>备受争议的第二段婚姻，用现在眼光看来却也是另一种合伙人+员工关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a>如何看待生死，她早已有答案</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：高胜美 - 青青河边草</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;邓丽君 - 在水一方</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;蔡琴 - 庭院深深</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;童孔,张雨生 - 两个永恒</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;蔡琴 - 最后一夜</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;动力火车-当</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loTyYiNueay3SYrL3IDoyGSJCemZ.m4a" length="51317096" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:35:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiW_7SEIBze3FnFxdN-j0ZtmTG8h.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【别再问我什么是嘻哈】-成都rapper指定入学教材</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674885a4c3b2a2f334312160</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674885a4c3b2a2f334312160</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Nov 2024 15:13:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>HELLO, 你们好呀，欢迎收听最新的节目，本期我们要读的书是《别再问我什么是嘻哈》！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="98">01:38</a>嘻哈和说唱的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a>锐评中国嘻哈，为什么成都rapper需要读这本书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a>起源：你的根是什么根，你的恨是什么恨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a>嘻哈发展史也是现代音乐设备发展史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">23:40</a>匪帮说唱 gang gang到底是要灭了谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1850">30:50</a>嘻哈和摇滚，到底谁更有超越性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a>这本书读的不容易，听的音乐还是不够多，以及日-美-中三种语言和思维以及视角下的阅读转换</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>影视：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《川渝陷阱》《冲出康普顿》《嘻哈进化史》</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e509e6f418a84a046b30971" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5e509e6f418a84a046b30971"><span>The Park</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657834cf33be65a50f89191e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657834cf33be65a50f89191e"><span>【忽左忽右】第288期：图帕克谋杀案背后的说唱战争</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668dc08356c473415f9f9960" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/668dc08356c473415f9f9960"><span>【野地电波】：从2Pac到biggie，嘻哈史上最大悬案背后的说唱匪帮传奇</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5f76ad5e83c34e85dd5b7d23" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/5f76ad5e83c34e85dd5b7d23"><span>【别的电波】：假期特辑 超越这一天 feat 西海之声&nbsp;</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>文章：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vfO-XR4gW4FrNLf3DyrC-w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/vfO-XR4gW4FrNLf3DyrC-w"><span>袁越-《嘻哈的起源》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>BGM: The J.B.'s - Pass The Peas</span></p><span></span><p><span>Earth, Wind &amp; Fire - Let's Groove</span></p><span></span><p><span>James Brown - Funky Drummer (Pt. 1 &amp; 2)</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Sugarhill Gang - Rapper's Delight</span></p><span></span><p><span>Chic - Good Times</span></p><span></span><p><span>Afrika Bambaataa - Planet Rock</span></p><span></span><p><span>N.W.A - &nbsp;Fxxx tha Police</span></p><span></span><p><span>Herbie Hancock - Rockit</span></p><span></span><p><span>Aerosmith,Run-D.M.C. - Walk This Way</span></p><span></span><p><span>Nile Rodgers,Chic,Lady Gaga - I Want Your Love</span></p>]]></description>
